.DS_Store

# Datasets are intentionally tracked (kept in the repo) — see "Data access" in README.

# Trained model checkpoints are intentionally tracked (each is ~90 KB; see README) —
# they are the reproducibility artifact, not a build byproduct.

# Logs and run artifacts
*.log
runs/
wandb/

# Internal reports, audits, and reviewer correspondence — never public
reports/
paper/

# Packaged release archives (e.g. Zenodo snapshots) — build artifacts, not source
*.zip

# Result JSONs (regenerable by re-running training)
results/lstm/*.json
results/gnn/*.json
results/gnn_tl/*.json

# Jupyter
.ipynb_checkpoints/

# OS
Thumbs.db

# Claude Code local state
.claude/
CLAUDE.md

# PDFs — papers, thesis, IEEE templates, figure exports (regenerable; not shipped)
*.pdf

# Markdown — keep ONLY the root README.md; reports/notes stay out of the public repo
*.md
!/README.md
